  "details": "I have a few friends with social anxiety who say they only feel comfortable in worlds with three to five other people in the world, and a few people I know have low specs on their devices and get kicked or have the game completely crash if too many people join an instance. A fix to both of these could be a new public instance setting- where you can manually set the amount of people allowed in a new public instance you start. That way you can meet new people without triggering your anxiety or your pc deciding crash the game",
